      <title>Brian Breiland</title>
      <link>https://www.tbnewswatch.com/obituaries/brian-breiland-11901726</link>
      <description>Brian Breiland, aged 82, of Thunder Bay, Ontario, passed away peacefully on February 15th, 2026, surrounded by loved ones. Brian was born on August 29th, 1943, in Port Arthur to parents Verna and Haakon Breiland of Port Arthur, Thunder Bay.</description>
